# Records infra/local/demo.sh against a running local stack. Regenerate with: make video
Output docs/demo.gif
Output docs/demo.mp4
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1180
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show
Type "bash infra/local/demo.sh"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 58s
Sleep 3s
